msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:8
msgid "`nix store` - manipulate a Nix store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:12
msgid "`nix store` \\[_option_...\\] _subcommand_"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:14
msgid "where _subcommand_ is one of the following:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:16
#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:38
msgid "**Available commands:**"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:18
msgid ""
"[`nix store add`](./nix3-store-add.md) - add a file or directory to the Nix "
"store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:19
msgid ""
"[`nix store add-file`](./nix3-store-add-file.md) - Deprecated. Use [`nix "
"store add --mode flat`](../../command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-add.md) instead."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:20
msgid ""
"[`nix store add-path`](./nix3-store-add-path.md) - Deprecated alias to [`nix "
"store add`](../../command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-add.md)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:21
msgid ""
"[`nix store cat`](./nix3-store-cat.md) - print the contents of a file in the "
"Nix store on stdout"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:22
msgid ""
"[`nix store copy-log`](./nix3-store-copy-log.md) - copy build logs between "
"Nix stores"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:23
msgid ""
"[`nix store copy-sigs`](./nix3-store-copy-sigs.md) - copy store path "
"signatures from substituters"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:24
msgid ""
"[`nix store delete`](./nix3-store-delete.md) - delete paths from the Nix "
"store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:25
msgid ""
"[`nix store diff-closures`](./nix3-store-diff-closures.md) - show what "
"packages and versions were added and removed between two closures"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:26
msgid ""
"[`nix store dump-path`](./nix3-store-dump-path.md) - serialise a store path "
"to stdout in NAR format"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:27
msgid ""
"[`nix store gc`](./nix3-store-gc.md) - perform garbage collection on a Nix "
"store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:28
msgid ""
"[`nix store info`](./nix3-store-info.md) - test whether a store can be "
"accessed"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:29
msgid ""
"[`nix store ls`](./nix3-store-ls.md) - show information about a path in the "
"Nix store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:30
msgid ""
"[`nix store make-content-addressed`](./nix3-store-make-content-addressed.md) "
"- rewrite a path or closure to content-addressed form"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:31
msgid ""
"[`nix store optimise`](./nix3-store-optimise.md) - replace identical files "
"in the store by hard links"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:32
msgid ""
"[`nix store path-from-hash-part`](./nix3-store-path-from-hash-part.md) - get "
"a store path from its hash part"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:33
msgid ""
"[`nix store prefetch-file`](./nix3-store-prefetch-file.md) - download a file "
"into the Nix store"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:34
msgid "[`nix store repair`](./nix3-store-repair.md) - repair store paths"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:35
msgid ""
"[`nix store sign`](./nix3-store-sign.md) - sign store paths with a local key"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:36
msgid ""
"[`nix store verify`](./nix3-store-verify.md) - verify the integrity of store "
"paths"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store.md:40
msgid ""
"[`nix store roots-daemon`](./nix3-store-roots-daemon.md) - run a daemon that "
"returns garbage collector roots on request"
msgstr ""

